## Status
This is a STUB. Full Nougat extraction (`.mmd` with LaTeX-preserved math,
tables, and figure captions) has NOT been run for this slot. The
replication was completed using the plain-text extraction at
`../artifacts/paper.txt` produced by `pdftotext`, which was sufficient for
